# Paths writable in the read-only states (1 BRAINSTORMING, 2 SPECIFICATION, 3 PLAN) and with no active intent.
# Bash glob syntax (`*` crosses `/`), relative to the repo root. Extend per repo in .aiops/config/readonly-exempt.
# .aiops/ is always governed by the artifact rules instead. Policy and behaviour files (CLAUDE.md, REVIEW.md,
# skills/, agents/) are deliberately NOT exempt: they change how agents work and go through the lifecycle.
docs/* documentation
README.md project readme
*/README.md folder readmes
CHANGELOG.md release notes
CONTRIBUTING.md contributor guide
SECURITY.md security policy
